<contentList>
	<content contentuid="hff6e70b0g61b1g41c0g9c74g87f9d200502a" version="1">动量传递</content>
	<content contentuid="h32104342g2f35g47d9g9e7bg2c42cfb4c36c" version="1">造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;时，你还会将敌人击退&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;，每次攻击最多触发一次。若敌人处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MOLECULATION_1"&gt;分子化&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态，其等级会提升至高于来源允许上限一级。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2a47c663gb744g4bc3g9d07gcd8cbad4f64f" version="1">压滞</content>
	<content contentuid="hc916c4ffge4cag4ec7g8a00g75f7349fd3d2" version="1">处于你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MOLECULATION_1"&gt;分子化&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态的较小敌人失去&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;点&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint"&gt;反应&lt;/LSTag&gt;。大型敌人与首领在自己每回合开始时提升至下一级&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MOLECULATION_1"&gt;分子化&lt;/LSTag&gt;，处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLOW"&gt;减速&lt;/LSTag&gt;或&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HASTE"&gt;加速&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态时速度加倍。</content>
	<content contentuid="h81d33412gc81dg4753g94f5g2a564bd8c5bb" version="1">事件视界</content>
	<content contentuid="hfe6741fdg2d9eg4384gb7e7g89adc8d4a485" version="1">你在战斗外看到的敌对生物先攻降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha1da12e5g2e8fg4f52gb90eg556e24cc817c" version="1">潮汐撕裂</content>
	<content contentuid="h5d835080g43c0g44fdg9596g759a294a73b0" version="1">处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLOW"&gt;减速&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态的敌人&lt;b&gt;还会&lt;/b&gt;受到你造成的&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8272eb37gb498g45e5g985ag230eb60e1d2b" version="1">束缚态</content>
	<content contentuid="h3cced77eg2c2fg413eg9ea4g2449c51a6473" version="1">该生物处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MOLECULATION_1"&gt;分子化&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态期间失去&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;点&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint"&gt;反应&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h48df27fcg8ddeg474dga759gad77fd10b0d7" version="1">参数共振</content>
	<content contentuid="hae8caa0cg3cdfg4811g80e6g9912c693b79c" version="1">该生物在自己每回合开始时提升至下一级&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MOLECULATION_1"&gt;分子化&lt;/LSTag&gt;，处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLOW"&gt;减速&lt;/LSTag&gt;或&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HASTE"&gt;加速&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态时速度加倍。持续至该生物脱离&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MOLECULATION_1"&gt;分子化&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6363d33bg1763g4571g91bbgd2f97780d789" version="1">时间膨胀</content>
	<content contentuid="hb731be74gc1d2g4338ga339g28058c3c2f1d" version="1">先攻降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
</contentList>
